<title>USA: Unitil CEO/chairman Peter Stulgis dies.</title>
<headline>Unitil CEO/chairman Peter Stulgis dies.</headline>
<dateline>HAMPTON, N.H. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unitil Corp said its chairman and chief executive officer, Peter Stulgis, died Sunday evening after a brief illness.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Stulgis was 47. The matter of who will replace Stulgis will be dealt with in due course, he added.</p>
<p>The company's chairman of the executive committee and former chief executive, Charles Tunney, said in a statement that Stulgis had established a clear long-term direction for the company and a very strong management team in place at the utility company.</p>
<p>&quot;The executive committee strongly endorses this plan and will pursue it,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
